          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 62428,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Nina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>NinaNina</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Po obu stronach operatora <code>===</code> znajduje się ten sam ciąg znaków. Co wyświetli porównanie?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Nina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>NinaNina</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>Nina</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 62693,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Użyj operatora porównania, aby porównać <code>score</code> z <code>expected</code> i wyświetlić w konsoli <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" expected = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score === expected);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
